{"4146020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deery Me", "steam_appid": 4146020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Lord requires sacrifice. Travel the forest and hunt it's creatures, collect their eyes, and offer them to Him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deery Me is a first-person retro horror shooter. You hunt deer in a forest and collect their eyes for sacrifice. Upon sacrificing, you sleep for the day, where you will have to complete a dream to progress further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware, deer aren't the only creatures that inhabit this forest. You will need to survive the horrors that lurk.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Kill Deer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146020/extras/9b852835c13e0d4f291629bc948c5e36.poster.avif?t=1776362317\" width=480 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146020/extras/9b852835c13e0d4f291629bc948c5e36.webm?t=1776362317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146020/extras/9b852835c13e0d4f291629bc948c5e36.mp4?t=1776362317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sacrifice Their Eyes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146020/extras/4caa5ef07c2bb734d1ae31efad46ab41.poster.avif?t=1776362317\" width=480 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4146020/extras/4caa5ef07c2bb734d1ae31efad46ab41.webm?t=1776362317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a